#. <CLT 4>こうして…戦刃むくろの学級裁判が終わった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And that's how the class trial of Mukuro Ikusaba came\n"
"to an end...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんは、本当に犯人じゃなかったのか…
#. それとも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I still had to wonder whether Kyoko was actually\n"
"innocent, or...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その答えはもう出ない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Regardless, the truth was lost forever.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、ボクも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even for me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その事を考えるのはやめた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I just stopped thinking about it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これが、戦刃むくろの学級裁判の結末…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That was the end of Mukuro's class trial.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボク達にとっての、
#. “最後の学級裁判”の結末…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And in the end, it would prove to be our last class\n"
"trial.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、その事件を最後に、
#. もう２度と…希望ヶ峰学園で殺人は起きなかった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Once that case was over, there was never a single\n"
"murder at Hope's Peak ever again.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こうして、ボクらはみんなの犠牲と引き換えに、
#. 平和を手に入れたんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We had obtained peace, in exchange for the lives of\n"
"all the others...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この学園の中だけの平和…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Peace, but only inside the school...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらだけの平和…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Peace, but only for us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それが、ボクらの希望…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That was the only hope we had.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>希望…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hope.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>希望…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hope...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>希望…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hope...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…これが？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is hope?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. いや！　違うッ！！
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No! This isn't right!"
msgstr ""
